    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Anuú Paulo, ya/abusmoó Yesu Kristo ar sla'aarír Mungú, nee Timoteo hhiyaarén, barwaárí ngina gooiimaán ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "amorhúngií alé, kuungá' múk hhohhó' oo Mungú oo baraá yaamaá Kolosai, kudá' hhaeerén awa inkihhimuú koomá' baraá Kristowo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú Baabá kuungá' nu tsuuqi nee nu waydií haniisi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Atén deelo sleémeero Mungú, Baabuú Aakoorén Yesu Kristo un sluufmiisaán, qoomár burnu aleefiriiriimaán. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma aga axaasaán kuungá' adór Kristo Yesu kura haratlintié', nee adór múk hhohhó' oo Mungú sleémeero kura slaé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú un sluufmiisaán as haraxu'utidá' ta koonda', ar taa amohhe'eés gawaá doorí wa ale as kuungá'. Kángw haraxu'utirí una axasé' qoomár Ya/abtór hho' ar ló' niwa amorhúng i hardát. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya/abtoorí hho' in tsiyaayaaxát baraá yaamu sleémeerowo nee in tsuuqaá yaariír huwaahúp. Tam dirhunge sleeme a adoorí, iimír bál kángw tsuuqaá Mungú kuwa axasé', nee adór i dirii'iya' kiri tsaahha hhe'esé'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kaangwí kunguna dirhúng i intsaahhatimís nee Epafra, sla'aarusmoorén. Inós a lawaalmoó Kristo adór atén wa ale, slám an sagadiyusmoó Kristo oo inkihhím as atén. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós kángw sla'aarirhúng tidá' Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú naa dirhúng i haniís, nguna dirén i alki/iít.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gawaá adoorihe iimír kaangwí kuwa axaasaán, atén kuungá' naa mawaaniiká aleefirooro. An firiiriimaán as Mungú nuwa sagalooárí haniisi nee aleesleemuú amór Qeeruú hhoohhoó' oo Mungú daáhh, as sla'aarirós kawa tsaahha hhe'esa'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní a aleesleerá' tawa hota' ar adór hariím dír Aakoowo, Aako kuri qwal/atisá', nee adoodá' inós i slai kari tlehhitá'. An malé firiimaán as kuungá' umuúqo gár hhoo' kawa tlehhita', nee tawa kumita' Mungú kuwa tsatsahhaanda'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An firiiriimaán as kahhó' Mungú baraá aleesleemuuwós kudá' xirfuú kooma, kuungá' nuwa /uuruú i haniisi, as tawa qitla' baraá mura' sleémeero oo ti'imiita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Daqaní kuungá' Baabá kuri sluufmisá' ar qwal/amaaye, kudá' naa aleesleemuú i haniis oo tawa al dinku'uumisa' nee múk hhohhó' oo Mungú baraá aalír waawuti'iimár gwa/aateemaawo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós atén tina baraá /uuruú giwtír wa ba/amis, tiri loohatís, tiri dahaás baraá waawuti'iimár Garmaawós oo sla'aarusmo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Garmaawós kunguna haniís as atén tiwa gweeri baraá /uuruú giwtír wa ale, gídaabaárós tlakweemaarén gina gurtláy.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kristo an slaqsoó geehhoó' oo Munguúdá' geehhooeeká. Inós an na/oó baris dír Munguhe baraá mura' sleémeero kudá' taa tleehhi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mungú mura' sleémeero oo gawaá doori nee oo baraakaá yaamu guna tleéhh ar inós, muruudá' geehhoó' nee kudá' geehhooeeká, kudá' baraá yaamaá qeeruú i dirií', adór kiteeraá aleesleemu, nee waawuti'iima nee geeraharuuse, nee kudá' sleémeero /uuruú koomá'. Mura' sleémeero Mungú guna tleéhh ar loohír Kristo, nee as inós. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós i daadeer iimír mura' sleémeero iwa deeruutiiká, nee baraawose mura' sleémeero in kumaamiit ar adoodá' ngura tleéhh. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Múk kríshaanáy a slaqwtós, nee inós a saga. Inós an iimu/úngw kríshaanáy. Inós an kudá' naa geerií waaslee/ baraá múk aa qaátl wa ale, as inós iwa iimu/úngw umuúqo gaa tleehhiti. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mungú gana slaá' Munguiimarós sleémeero iwa baraá Garmá i diri'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú mura' sleémeero guna amoorósií haraki/isár wa slaá' ar baraá Garmaawós. Wayda guri tleéhh ar gwa'arár Garmaawós ar gawaá msalaába. Gawaá adoorihe Mungú mura' sleémeero guna amoorósií ki/ís, kuduú baraá yaamu, nee oo dooriiwo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aáng kuungá' tunduwa saáw dír Munguhe, baraá munerhúng nee inslawayhunge kuungá' a wakuuseerós, asma tlehhemi'iihúng ki tlakw. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala hám daxta kuungá' sleeme naa amoorósií haraki/ís ar Garmaawós. Asma Garmaawós ina hoót iri gwaá' as kuungá' nuwa amohhe'eesi, tawa sihhita' dír geeraawós i alé, tawa múk hhohhó' oo xaslxaanslír koomaaká, tam oo hhasaám wásl. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ala kuungá' gár tunduwa hariím masók an kumitá' baraá haratlintaaooro, tawa sihhita' ar gawdeema gawaá iihhafiirír gawít i alé, nee tawa qutla'aaká baraá haraxu'utír taa sleeré' qoomár Ya/abtór hho' kawa axasé'. Ya/abtoorí hho' kaa alki/iít baraá yaamu sleémeero, nee anuú Paulo tina sagadiyusmoowós wa qaás.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hám daxta a qwalalaá/ asma tiwa slahh'eemisi as kuungá'. Án baraá slaqwte'eene birti slahh'eemiis, a slahh'eemisuú Kristo un boo/eemiís, kudá' aa meet baraá slahh'eemisuuwós as slaqwtós. Slaqwtós an múk kríshaanáy. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mungú aníng ina sagadiyusmoó múk kríshaanáy wa qaás. Gadiyér afhhamít ngina aníng i saayín as kuungá'. Gadiyeérí an Ya/abtór Mungú ngiwa gwa/atisa hhe'ees dirhúngií ale. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ya/abtoodá' a lu/aaroó Mungú oo taa luú/ dír qartadá' aa geerií waarahhi, baraá kureeraá yaariir naa waarahhi'i, ala hám daxta kingina geehhooatís dír mukós oo hhohhoe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Asma Mungú gana slaá' ngiwa gwa/atisi dir'íní alé adór lu/aaráydá' ir daqaari'iimár kón nee xirif baraá múk xoorduuwo. Lu/aaráy an kwí, Kristo i baraahúng i dirii'. Gawaá adoorihe kuungá' haraxu'uti a koondá' ar xirfuú Mungú kuwa sleera'. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.27"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inós an kwí ni alki/iitaan, muu sleémeero un gurbu'uumaán. Umuúqo heewo un intsaahhatimiisaán ar sagalooa sleémeero tidá' Mungú ni amoorén i hanmiisi. Asma gár ta sla'aan a umuú heewo un amohhe'eemisaán iwa sihhiiti dír geeraá Mungú tawa heé aa kwaa/ baraá Kristoowo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.28"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "COL 1:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aníng a gadiyuús nee a naagamiís as gadiyeédá' ngiwa boo/ees, ar baraá /uuruudá' úr oo Kristo ni aníng i hanmiisi, /uuruudá' ló'wa gadiyuús baraaeé' wa ale.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "COL.1.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "COL.1.29"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
